## A [[thing]] which is [[monstrously]] [[great#Adjective|great]] in [[size#Noun|size]], strength, etc. (especially a [[ship#Noun|ship]]); also, a [[person#Noun|person]] with great [[power#Noun|power]] or [[wealth]].
