===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:laumpe|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|laumpe}}, {{m|enm|lampe}}, from {{der|en|fro|lampe||lamp, light}}, from {{der|en|la|lampas||torch, lamp, light}}, from {{der|en|grc|λαμπάς||torch, lamp, beacon, light, meteor}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*leh₂p-||to shine}}. Cognate with {{cog|lt|lópė||light}}, {{cog|cy|llachar||bright}}. Displaced native {{cog|ang|lēohtfæt|lit=light-vat}}.

