# The condition of being [[free]].
#: {{ux|en|The army is here, your '''liberty''' is assured.}}
#* {{RQ:Lincoln Gettysburg|Nicolay|1|Four score and seven years ago our fathers brought forth, upon this continent, a new nation, conceived in '''liberty''', and dedicated to the proposition that "all men are created equal"{{sic}}}}
